  B -->|None — ASP.NET Core| P[Resume on pool thread]
  B -->|Present — UI / legacy ASP.NET| C{ConfigureAwait?}
  C -->|true default| U[Post to context thread]
  C -->|false| P
  U --> D{Risk: caller blocked on Result?}
  D -->|Yes| X[Deadlock]

